# Fhenix SDK (Cursor)

When code imports `@cofhe/sdk` (or legacy `cofhejs`):

1. Use the canonical init path (`createCofheConfig` → `createCofheClient` → `connect`).
2. Choose decrypt flow deliberately: `decryptForView` vs `decryptForTx().withPermit()` vs `.withoutPermit()` (the last requires on-chain `FHE.allowPublic` / allowGlobal).
3. Timestamps for permits/deadlines are **Unix seconds**, not milliseconds.
4. Prefer live lookup of current SDK signatures from public Fhenix repos rather than inventing APIs.

See `plugins/fhenix-toolkit/skills/fhenix-sdk/SKILL.md` and `fhenix-review` for the gotcha catalog.
